{{!
    @template tool_vae/cell_content

    What a cell of a table holds: parts side by side, with no space between them (a comment carries each line break of
    the template, so that no space is drawn).

    Every text comes from the context, given by tool_vae\output\cell_content; the template holds no logic beyond its
    sections. Every text, label, address and class is escaped (double braces). One key is HTML, placed as it is (triple
    braces): texthtml, made by the core (format_string(), or a method of the renderer such as a button).

    Each kind of part is an object, never a bare string: a section that tested the string itself would draw nothing for
    the text "0", which Mustache holds for empty.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * parts - array of parts, each with the five keys below, one of them set and the others false:
        * text - false, or {label}: a text
        * link - false, or {url, label}: a link
        * span - false, or {class, label}: a span with its classes
        * div - false, or {class, label}: a block with its classes
        * html - false, or {texthtml}: HTML made by the core

    Example context (json):
    {
        "parts": [
            {"text": {"label": "DEMO — "}, "link": false, "span": false, "div": false, "html": false},
            {"text": false, "link": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=3", "label": "Camille Durand"},
                "span": false, "div": false, "html": false},
            {"text": false, "link": false, "span": {"class": "small text-muted", "label": "Read only"}, "div": false,
                "html": false},
            {"text": false, "link": false, "span": false, "div": {"class": "small text-muted", "label": "Prepares the dossier."},
                "html": false},
            {"text": false, "link": false, "span": false, "div": false, "html": {"texthtml": "<strong>Demo</strong>"} }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#parts}}{{#text}}{{label}}{{/text}}{{!
}}{{#link}}<a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/link}}{{!
}}{{#span}}<span class="{{class}}">{{label}}</span>{{/span}}{{!
}}{{#div}}<div class="{{class}}">{{label}}</div>{{/div}}{{!
}}{{#html}}{{{texthtml}}}{{/html}}{{/parts}}
